cient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\{\\begin{aligned}5x-8y+z=-1 \\\\ 9y=2 \\\\ 3x-y-8z=-4\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\{\\begin{aligned}5x-8y+z=-1 \\\\ 0x+9y+0z=2 \\\\ 3x-y-8z=-4\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}5 & \\,\\,\\,-8 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 9 & 0 \\\\ 3 & \\,\\,\\,-1 & \\,\\,\\,-8\\end{aligned}]\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186272222 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2ac47871-c103-58a8-8f16-909c70df42b5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ 5 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186269654} {:answer/id #uuid "3c86841b-ed46-5040-aa2b-a1a8bab39956" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186269822} {:answer/id #uuid "59bf1e0a-dfb7-501d-bedc-421fa698108a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186270067} {:answer/id #uuid "b191052c-00c6-58eb-90b6-173a61b8c26d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186270858} {:answer/id #uuid "c71d2ba7-d720-5c12-9fe1-550bd789cdb5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186271022}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2ac47871-c103-58a8-8f16-909c70df42b5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ 5 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186269654} :answer-field/id #uuid 