ystem of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}9x+3y-z=16 \\\\ 15-8x=-4y \\\\ -y+20x=3z\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}9x+3y-z=16 \\\\ -8x+4y+0z=-15 \\\\ 20x-y-3z=0\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}9 & 3 & -1 \\\\ -8 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 20 & -1 & -3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}9 & 3 & -1 & 16 \\\\ -8 & 4 & 0 & -15 \\\\ 20 & -1 & -3 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262947 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "25acd4f0-ba30-5b36-8c90-1831203b1161" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 8 & 1 & -7\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186260204} {:answer/id #uuid "96af161b-76be-5299-938e-4076afcfd557" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 8 & -7 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261181} {:answer/id #uuid "ac3601f1-7ad6-55ec-8751-657cf60badc3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 8 & 0 & -7\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261381} {:answer/id #uuid "b49404cc-59a5-51a0-ac1e-79d217a477d9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 8 & -7 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261464} {:answer/id #uuid "e8f0bc8c-4dc1-5511-b9c7-70ccd98219fe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -7 & 0 & 8\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261916}] :answer-field/correct {: