sists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a System of Linear Equations"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059769 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059578 :question/id #uuid "05942b5f-c165-59c6-8b67-24bc8dd40cca" :question/math-academy-id "e-4685" :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n![](images/4d/4d90e81043121495ae8bb7742400b2c9e705cb7d706f553a6ab2aec44b35d017.png)" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and $y,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n![](images/3e/3e7f783023405be3ea79a740998fefac3a6ea909e9903f5ea300a9234ae63003.png)"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "d7c8f4da-c782-51e0-ac51-87a89f31860d" :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060198 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9b53768c-9e88-55a9-b61b-39576efc1a5a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{-\\frac{1}{2}x + y = 0; \\frac{1}{2}x - y = 0; x + \\frac{1}{2}z = 0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057649} {:answer/id #uuid "ff03a4b3-5c91-50d2-8368-6a90c835c859" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{-\\frac{1}{2}y + z = 0; \\frac{1}{2}x - y = 0; y - \\frac{1}{2}z = 0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057650} {:answer/id #uuid "3f133cc7-3f01-5987-9720-878ec58482f2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{-\\frac{1}{2}y + z = 0; \\frac{1}{2}y - z = 0; x + \\frac{1}{2}z = 0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057651} {:answer/id #uuid "4529cc37-932a-510a-ab51-4dea47e7e6c8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\frac{1}{2}y + z = 0; \\frac{1}{2}x - y = 0; x - \\frac{1}{2}z = 0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057652} {:answer/id #uuid "75329838-8009-5563-a4b9-1ae3ae0303ba" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{-\\frac{1}{2}y + z = 0; \\frac{1}{2}x - y = 0; x + \\frac{1}{2}z = 0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057653}] :answer-field/id #uuid "4c5e36a6-331f-5bc3-8658-14c997854cb6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186057648}] :question/id #uuid "4514de1d-440c-55f2-8b33-90bb5f4dd54d" :question/math-academy-id "q-20223" :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -\\frac{1}{2} & 1 & 0 \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0\\end{bmatrix}$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060395 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c1003d7e-42ef-59a2-9038-178e1c676be1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{x - 2y = 10; - x + y =-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058993} {:answer/id #uuid "c4ded7fa-c1f6-5aad-8a94-f332f052ff6c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{x - 2y = 0; - x + y = 2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058994} {:answer/id #uuid "e51ccf34-2862-5dcc-bb64-f8f734bc2e82" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{x + 2y = 10; x + y =-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058995} {:answer/id #uuid "eac00324-c2df-502b-b5dd-ba0a44acfb6b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{x + 2y = 1; - x + y =-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058996} {:answer/id #uuid "038c96de-d924-5dda-835b-036092e680cc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{x - 2y = 10; x + y = 2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058997}] :answer-field/id #uuid "f473abb5-e351-5444-b66f-186a774f8f2c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058992} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "64df3633-b59c-5a2c-a47b-ac990893af30" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x-2y=0 \\\\ -x+y=2\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186403490} {:answer/id #uuid "bd635cf4-1b1c-55e3-b846-cf1074404d1f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x-2y=10 \\\\ x+y=2\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186403491} {:answer/id #uuid "f08977b3-da5b-5a3f-9b5f-51a1b0b73af2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x-2y=10 \\\\ -x+y=-2\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186403492} {:answer/id #uuid "d79b540e-61c1-524a-aada-7bc8f0c88fc5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x+2y=10 \\\\ x+y=-2\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186403493} {:answer/id #uuid "a1094fb0-5cb4-5005-a45b-91f8fd20411a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x+2y=1 \\\\ -x+y=-2\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186403494}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f08977b3-da5b-5a3f-9b5f-51a1b0b73af2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x-2y=10 \\\\ -x+y=-2\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186403492} :answer-field/id #uuid "dc9e5b69-52ca-5647-a69d-a0b8ed7e52f1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186403489}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "611f1d4a-3c30-50c6-9215-73810a99de02" :question/math-academy-id "q-71724" :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 10 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and  $y$,  the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-2y=10 \\\\ -x+y=-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262949 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "983eae80-935c-5bec-83d4-bb70472b649c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y=9 \\\\ -3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261196} {:answer/id #uuid "9d5d1998-f70a-5eae-ac2d-6b2c8cf4550c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y+z=9 \\\\ -3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261237} {:answer/id #uuid "9d9e1b79-301c-56e0-bec8-3ddd45a92a4f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y+9z=0 \\\\ -3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261241} {:answer/id #uuid "b184a01d-d736-54db-869c-f41ebd52dbb5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y-9z=1 \\\\ 3x+y+5z=1 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261444} {:answer/id #uuid "bf8ba9dd-0385-584b-87ab-7f38dee02799" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}7x+4y=9 \\\\ 3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x+4y+8z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261567}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "983eae80-935c-5bec-83d4-bb70472b649c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y=9 \\\\ -3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186261196} :answer-field/id #uuid "01ca573b-9f89-5340-8019-f697b0475e49" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186262127}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "6f17144b-ab57-54e9-ad05-2f94341c0d36" :question/math-academy-id "q-129132" :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}7 & -4 & 0 & 9 \\\\ -3 & 1 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -4 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$, $y$, and $z,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y+0z=9 \\\\ -3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy simplifying, we obtain\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y=9 \\\\ -3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186287985 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1908e8ba-85bd-5cb6-bc00-81f1184ac3c5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}2y+3z=0 \\\\ 2x+3z=2 \\\\ 2x+3y=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285010} {:answer/id #uuid "a19af00f-030d-5887-8f4c-c3a01aca7679" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}y+3z=0 \\\\ 2x-3z=2 \\\\ 2x+3y=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286265} {:answer/id #uuid "bd5ae993-6af4-51b4-be7a-507fdb87d03e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}2y+3z=0 \\\\ x+3z=2 \\\\ 2x+3y=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286518} {:answer/id #uuid "d2616c6a-96c4-56a1-bd78-ebcd5a28b775" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}2y-3z=0 \\\\ 2x+3z=2 \\\\ 2x+y=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286700} {:answer/id #uuid "d2eda896-e492-511a-8500-fe07f9d246bd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}2y+3z=0 \\\\ 2x+3z=2 \\\\ x-3y=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286704}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1908e8ba-85bd-5cb6-bc00-81f1184ac3c5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}2y+3z=0 \\\\ 2x+3z=2 \\\\ 2x+3y=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285010} :answer-field/id #uuid "751f884c-24a8-5042-b733-50c635a40ab5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287395}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "4001e867-1b39-597f-be35-d38068603d60" :question/math-academy-id "q-20363" :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$, $y$, and $z,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}0x+2y+3z=0 \\\\ 2x+0y+3z=2 \\\\ 2x+3y+0z=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy simplifying, we obtain: \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2y+3z=0 \\\\ 2x+3z=2 \\\\ 2x+3y=3\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186287986 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "52942026-0708-50da-8155-f5d6d14abc9e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}4x+y+z=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}x+z=-6 \\\\ 3x+\\frac{1}{2}y+6z=\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285547} {:answer/id #uuid "713fc4b6-a412-5dde-a136-b5f3208fa57b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}4x-y+z=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}x+2z=6 \\\\ 3x+\\frac{1}{2}y+6z=\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285827} {:answer/id #uuid "75e324df-b042-54f3-8d45-cb36f6c6665a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}4x+y+z=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}x+2z=6 \\\\ 3x+\\frac{1}{2}y+6z=\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285885} {:answer/id #uuid "9d155d00-a9e3-584b-9988-6f1b0b0823bf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}4x+y+z=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}x-2z=6 \\\\ 3x+\\frac{1}{2}y+6z=\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286225} {:answer/id #uuid "f885db08-8273-5caa-af3e-f21329ad7d3b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}4x+y+z=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}x+2z=6 \\\\ 3x-\\frac{1}{2}y+6z=\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287058}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "75e324df-b042-54f3-8d45-cb36f6c6665a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}4x+y+z=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}x+2z=6 \\\\ 3x+\\frac{1}{2}y+6z=\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285885} :answer-field/id #uuid "36f986fd-ddb5-517b-acb1-8c548d9719c8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287261}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "9027f370-8a34-5149-a818-35d99113c4e6" :question/math-academy-id "q-20367" :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}4 & 1 & 1 & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4} & 0 & 2 & 6 \\\\ 3 & \\frac{1}{2} & 6 & \\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$, $y$, and $z,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}4x+y+z=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}x-0y+2z=6 \\\\ 3x+\\frac{1}{2}y+6z=\\frac{1}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy simplifying, we obtain \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}4x+y+z=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}x+2z=6 \\\\ 3x+\\frac{1}{2}y+6z=\\frac{1}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186338977 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5d35e2f4-19f1-5cb1-8a8f-39da694de163" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x+2y-4z=3 \\\\ -x+y-z=2 \\\\ 2x+2y+z=1\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336876} {:answer/id #uuid "6725ec81-9c9f-56f8-8ae4-0686d795ec53" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x+4y-2z=3 \\\\ -x+y-z=2 \\\\ 2x+y+2z=1\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336952} {:answer/id #uuid "67ee1e90-2905-517b-bff8-b395951e0b81" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x+4y-2z=3 \\\\ x+y+z=2 \\\\ 2x+2y+z=1\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186336959} {:answer/id #uuid "7d1a8629-faf0-5628-a647-b59ed9c8c03c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x+4y-2z=3 \\\\ -x+y-z=2 \\\\ 2x+2y+z=1\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186337159} {:answer/id #uuid "d7fb5d8d-4408-525e-828f-a0deb29a682b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x+4y-2z=3 \\\\ -x+y-z=1 \\\\ 2x+2y+z=2\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186337908}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7d1a8629-faf0-5628-a647-b59ed9c8c03c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x+4y-2z=3 \\\\ -x+y-z=2 \\\\ 2x+2y+z=1\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186337159} :answer-field/id #uuid "86808fb5-ecf5-5601-90da-b1ad500e2611" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186338522}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "4253a0fa-e80c-5958-8134-9debe2aef552" :question/math-academy-id "q-71723" :question/problem "What would be the system of equatio